 r←Inject
⍝ The JavaScript EWC evaluates in the client the first time an ApexChart object
⍝ is created.
⍝ Register mounts assets/ as the virtual folder /apexcharts/, so this is an
⍝ ordinary ES module import.
 r←'import(window.EWC.url("/apexcharts/ewc-apexcharts.js")).then(m => m.register(window.EWC))'
